llenges and the business requirements. I particularly like your <strong>hyb=
rid client-server strategy</strong> and the use of <strong>Web Workers for =
non-blocking operations</strong>.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Now, let's talk about a specific=
