<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">I'd also implement <strong>data =
staleness indicators</strong> to show users when their data might be outdat=
ed, and <strong>offline caching</strong> using IndexedDB to maintain some f=
unctionality during network outages.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>How would you optimize t=
his for mobile devices where performance is more constrained?</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Candidate</strong>: Mobi=
le optimization would involve several strategies:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Adaptive rendering</str=
ong>: Reduce the number of visible columns on smaller screens and lower the=
 virtual scrolling item height for smoother performance</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Data prioritization</st=
rong>: Only load essential fields initially and lazy-load additional data o=
n demand</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Touch-friendly interact=
ions</strong>: Implement swipe gestures for sorting and horizontal scrollin=
g for table navigation</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Battery optimization</s=
trong>: Reduce update frequency when the app is backgrounded using the Page=
 Visibility API</li>
</ol>
